      "estimated_seconds": 240,
      "adaptation_hooks": [],
      "markdown": "## Reconnaître un gaz à ses raies\n\nLes niveaux d'énergie sont **quantifiés**. Une transition de n₂ vers n₁ émet un photon d'énergie E = hν. Pour l'hydrogène, les transitions vers n=2 donnent la **série de Balmer**, dans le visible — la signature qui permet de *reconnaître un gaz inconnu*.",
      "render_assets": [
        {
          "kind": "equation_latex",
          "title": "Énergie d'un photon émis",
          "payload": "E_{photon} = h\\nu = \\left| E_{n_2} - E_{n_1} \\right|"
        },
        {
          "kind": "spectrum",
          "title": "Série de Balmer de l'hydrogène",
          "payload": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json\",\n  \"description\": \"Serie de Balmer de l'hydrogene (raies d'emission visibles)\",\n  \"width\": 360,\n  \"height\": 170,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"values\": [\n      {\n        \"lambda\": 656.5,\n        \"I\": 100,\n        \"raie\": \"Hα (n=3→2)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"lambda\": 486.3,\n        \"I\": 42,\n        \"raie\": \"Hβ (n=4→2)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"lambda\": 434.2,\n        \"I\": 23,\n        \"raie\": \"Hγ (n=5→2)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"lambda\": 410.3,\n        \"I\": 12,\n        \"raie\": \"Hδ (n=6→2)\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"mark\": {\n    \"type\": \"bar\",\n    \"size\": 4\n  },\n  \"encoding\": {\n    \"x\": {\n      \"field\": \"lambda\",\n      \"type\": \"quantitative\",\n      \"scale\": {\n        \"domain\": [\n          395,\n          670\n        ]\n      },\n      \"title\": \"longueur d'onde λ (nm)\"\n    },\n    \"y\": {\n      \"field\": \"I\",\n      \"type\": \"quantitative\",\n      \"title\": \"intensite relative\"\n    },\n    \"color\": {\n      \"field\": \"raie\",\n      \"type\": \"nominal\",\n      \"legend\": {\n        \"title\": \"raie\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tooltip\": [\n      {\n        \"field\": \"raie\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"field\": \"lambda\",\n        \"title\": \"λ (nm)\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}",
          "format": "vega-lite",
          "provenance": "Rydberg formula (generate_assets.py)"
        }
      ]
    },
